      "message": "Double-check whether `sys_heap_usable_size` already handles `NULL`. Looks like you have a test (`test_sys_alloc_usable_size_handles_null`) for it too, so same as other comment that if it handles `NULL` correctly we can just add a comment here instead of another check.",
